      "source": "Retrieve a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.scripting/javax/script/ScriptEngine.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.script\"><code>ScriptEngine</code></a> from the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.scripting/javax/script/ScriptEngineManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.script\"><code>ScriptEngineManager</code></a>\nby name, delegating to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.scripting/javax/script/ScriptEngineManager.html#getEngineByName(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in javax.script\"><code>ScriptEngineManager.getEngineByName(String)</code></a> but\nthrowing a descriptive exception if not found or if initialization failed.",
      "translation": "从给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.scripting/javax/script/ScriptEngineManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.script\"><code>ScriptEngineManager</code></a> 按名称检索一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.scripting/javax/script/ScriptEngine.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.script\"><code>ScriptEngine</code></a>，委托给 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.scripting/javax/script/ScriptEngineManager.html#getEngineByName(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in javax.script\"><code>ScriptEngineManager.getEngineByName(String)</code></a>，但如果未找到或初始化失败则抛出描述性异常。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - if no matching engine has been found",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - 如果未找到匹配的引擎",
      "count": 2
